            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Sen",
            "review_text": "fjp4564\nSunshine Coast642 contributions\n0\nrelaxation combined with history\nJul 2013 • Friends\nThis coffee shop located a few minutes outside the city of Nha Trang is unique as it is established in a typical old Vietnamese Home that existed prior to the French colonisation. There is a lot of history to see and absorb in this coffee house, and it overlooks a lotus pond with a typical old Vietnamese bamboo bridge. A little away from the main road, it provides a quiet and pleasant surroundings for spending time sipping a coffee alone or with friends. Well worth a visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 8, 2013",
